1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,968
Welcome to Memberships!

2
00:00:01,968 --> 00:00:05,607
In this lesson, you'll create
an online course in Kyntlo.

3
00:00:05,607 --> 00:00:10,204
We'll set up a product, organise it
into categories, add a video lesson,

4
00:00:10,204 --> 00:00:11,162
and publish it.

5
00:00:11,162 --> 00:00:15,886
By the end, you'll have a real course
your customers can log in and watch.

6
00:00:16,743 --> 00:00:21,238
Memberships is where you build
courses, member areas and communities.

7
00:00:21,238 --> 00:00:23,193
It's included on the Pro plan.

8
00:00:23,193 --> 00:00:25,799
In Kyntlo, a course is called a product.

9
00:00:25,799 --> 00:00:29,122
Bloom already has two: one
for Invisalign patients,

10
00:00:29,122 --> 00:00:31,988
and one about caring
for your smile at home.

11
00:00:32,839 --> 00:00:34,948
Courses aren't just for coaches.

12
00:00:34,948 --> 00:00:39,363
A clinic can share aftercare videos,
a gym can share workout plans,

13
00:00:39,363 --> 00:00:41,868
and an agency can onboard new clients.

14
00:00:41,868 --> 00:00:45,624
Anything you explain again
and again can become a course.

15
00:00:45,624 --> 00:00:50,303
You record it once, and every customer
gets the same great explanation,

16
00:00:50,303 --> 00:00:51,753
any time they need it.

17
00:00:52,603 --> 00:00:53,837
Click Create Product.

18
00:00:53,837 --> 00:00:56,363
Give it a clear title,
Whitening Aftercare,

19
00:00:56,363 --> 00:00:59,888
and a short description that
tells members what they'll get.

20
00:01:00,705 --> 00:01:04,191
Click Create product, and you
land in the product builder.

21
00:01:04,191 --> 00:01:05,333
It's empty for now.

22
00:01:05,333 --> 00:01:09,359
On the right are the product details,
and the offers it belongs to.

23
00:01:10,222 --> 00:01:14,454
Courses are organised into
categories, like chapters in a book.

24
00:01:14,454 --> 00:01:18,417
Click Add Category, name it,
Your first 48 hours, and save.

25
00:01:19,267 --> 00:01:21,100
Each category holds lessons.

26
00:01:21,100 --> 00:01:23,914
Click Add Lesson to
open the lesson editor.

27
00:01:23,914 --> 00:01:26,467
A lesson can be a video, text, or both.

28
00:01:27,317 --> 00:01:30,127
Give the lesson a title,
then add your video.

29
00:01:30,127 --> 00:01:34,622
Upload a file straight from your
computer, or paste a link from YouTube,

30
00:01:34,622 --> 00:01:35,621
Vimeo or Wistia.

31
00:01:37,286 --> 00:01:40,885
Underneath, add text, like
notes, steps or a transcript.

32
00:01:40,885 --> 00:01:45,770
Members can read along, and it helps
anyone who prefers reading to watching,

33
00:01:45,770 --> 00:01:48,405
or who's somewhere they can't play sound.

34
00:01:49,211 --> 00:01:52,540
You can attach downloads too,
like a printable food guide,

35
00:01:52,540 --> 00:01:54,089
a checklist or a worksheet.

36
00:01:54,939 --> 00:01:56,163
Now set the status.

37
00:01:56,163 --> 00:02:00,347
Draft lessons are hidden from
members, so you can build in peace.

38
00:02:00,347 --> 00:02:02,536
When it's ready, choose Published.

39
00:02:02,536 --> 00:02:07,494
You can also drip content, releasing a
lesson a few days after someone joins.

40
00:02:08,389 --> 00:02:09,071
Click Save.

41
00:02:09,071 --> 00:02:12,602
Back in the builder, the lesson
sits inside its category.

42
00:02:12,602 --> 00:02:16,566
You can drag lessons and categories
to reorder them at any time.

43
00:02:17,416 --> 00:02:21,667
Click Preview to see exactly what
members see: the lessons on the left,

44
00:02:21,667 --> 00:02:25,498
the video and notes on the right,
and their progress as they go.

45
00:02:25,498 --> 00:02:29,988
Members mark lessons complete, and you
can see their progress in Analytics.

46
00:02:30,837 --> 00:02:31,897
Here's a pro tip.

47
00:02:31,897 --> 00:02:35,200
Keep each lesson to one
idea, and under five minutes.

48
00:02:35,200 --> 00:02:40,247
Short lessons get finished, and people
who finish a lesson come back for the next

49
00:02:40,247 --> 00:02:40,496
one.

50
00:02:40,496 --> 00:02:44,609
And short videos are much easier
to update when something changes.

51
00:02:45,458 --> 00:02:47,065
Your first course is built!

52
00:02:47,065 --> 00:02:51,708
In the next lesson, you'll turn it into
something people can buy, with offers,

53
00:02:51,708 --> 00:02:53,672
checkout and automatic enrolment.

54
00:02:53,672 --> 00:02:54,505
See you there.
